_:ffb97230a82a50e4d9753be1f5b57bc42b4b0486b58e31ff0de4c8973c3f2ba8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://j2h4u.github.io/supp-slotter/ontology/v1/show_match_details> .
